# Clint, West Justice

> Clint is a gold-lane marksman who turns every spell cast into a problem for the enemy backline. He is built for players who want lane pressure that converts into mid-game burst, not for those who plan to passively scale. If your draft cannot station one body between Clint and the first diver, pick a different marksman.

