## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-08. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Gold Lane Default (Gold)

- Items: Magic Boots, Endless Battle, Berserker's Fury, Haas's Claws, Malefic Roar, Blade of Despair
- Core: Endless Battle, Berserker's Fury, Malefic Roar
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Weapon Master, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Wind of Nature over Haas's Claws when Replace Haas's Claws when the enemy has two physical assassins who can reach you before your front line stabilizes.; Sea Halberd over Haas's Claws when Replace Haas's Claws when the enemy sustain structure (Estes, Floryn, Uranus, high-lifesteal fighters) keeps their front line alive through your poke.
- Total cost: 12520 gold

The ranked default. Endless Battle plus Berserker's Fury gives the two-item crit spike, Haas's Claws adds sustain and more crit chance, and Blade of Despair pushes late-game execution thresholds.

### Penetration Poke (Gold)

- Items: Magic Boots, Endless Battle, Hunter Strike, Blade of the Heptaseas, Malefic Roar, Blade of Despair
- Core: Endless Battle, Hunter Strike, Malefic Roar
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Weapon Master, Quantum Charge
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Berserker's Fury over Blade of the Heptaseas when Swap Heptaseas for Berserker's Fury when the game runs past minute 14 and you need crit scaling to stay relevant against late-game frontline items.; Immortality over Blade of the Heptaseas when Buy Immortality instead when one death loses the game and the enemy has a pick composition that guarantees at least one catch per fight.
- Total cost: 12070 gold

Higher CDR and ambush burst for games where you need to rotate skills faster and punish face-checks. Heptaseas synergizes with Clint's fog-of-war poke pattern, and Hunter Strike's movement speed lets you reposition after every trade.

### Anti-Dive Survival (Gold)

- Items: Tough Boots, Endless Battle, Berserker's Fury, Rose Gold Meteor, Malefic Roar, Wind of Nature
- Core: Endless Battle, Berserker's Fury, Malefic Roar
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Fatal, Weapon Master, Weakness Finder
- Battle spell: Purify
- Flex: Blade of Despair over Wind of Nature when Swap Wind of Nature for Blade of Despair if the enemy's physical dive becomes manageable after you get ahead or after your team builds enough peel.; Haas's Claws over Rose Gold Meteor when Replace Rose Gold Meteor with Haas's Claws if the enemy damage profile is physical but not burst-oriented, letting you sustain through extended trades instead of relying on a one-time shield.
- Total cost: 11210 gold

Built for games against double assassin or heavy dive. Tough Boots reduce CC lockout, Rose Gold Meteor grants a Lifeline shield that activates automatically, and Wind of Nature gives two seconds of physical immunity for the worst-case engagement.

